{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The nobles</b> — the honored ones among the nations." "And the sense of <b>the God of Abraham</b> — that they be a people to the God of Abraham, and he mentioned him on account of the souls he made in Haran, and he called in every place in the name of YHWH." "<b>The shields of the earth</b> — they are the kings, like 'for YHWH is our shield'; then the name will be exceedingly exalted before the eyes of all."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :register {:flags {1 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:07.754556511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}